## 6. Blast radius of any `TreVersion` taxonomy change

| Layer | Files / symbols touched |
|-------|-------------------------|
| **Enum + dispatch** | `TreVersion.h` (`enum`, `parseVersionString`, `recordStride`, `isCrcFirst`, `isEnumerateOnly`) |
| **Read path** | `TreArchive.cpp` (stride, security cap @168, TOC unpack loop @236-262); no `isCrcFirst` branch today |
| **Write path** | `TreBuilder.cpp` (`writeHeader` switch, stride, pad, build/repack guard) |
| **Mount metadata** | `TreMount.cpp` `versionToString`, `archiveInfos().enumerateOnly` |
| **N-API** | `tre_binding.cpp` (`BuildTre`, `RepackTre`, `MountArchiveAsyncWorker::versionToString`, `getMountArchives`) |
| **Codec seam** | `TreCodec.cpp/h` (`codecForTreVersion` — currently version-blind) |
| **TS contracts** | `packages/contracts/src/tre.ts` `TreVersion` union; `index.d.ts` buildTre version param docs |
| **Renderer** | `treMount.ts` `parseVersion`; `treStore.ts`; `MountedArchivesList`, `VfsTree`, `ProjectBindingBar` |
| **Deploy** | `packPatch.ts` hardcoded `'5000'` |
| **Fixtures** | `scripts/generate-tre-fixtures.js`, all `packages/harness/fixtures/tre/*`, optional `fixtures-real/` |
| **Tests** | All files in §4; e2e/workflow mocks using `'v0005'` |
| **Docs / planning** | `docs/01-core-engine/iff-and-tre.md`, `core3-parity.md`, `.planning/**` TRE-version notes |

Adding/removing/renaming an arm requires synchronized updates to: `parseVersionString`, `writeHeader` switch, `versionToString` (×2), TS unions, UI allowlist @ `treMount.ts:46`, arbiter allowlist @ `tre-fieldorder-arbiter.test.ts:144`, and any test magic-byte assertions.

---

