| Topic | Site A | Site B |
|-------|--------|--------|
| v6000 extract refusal | `TreArchive.h:10-11`, `tre_binding.cpp:519` | `TreArchive.cpp:319-329` (no version throw) |
| enumerate-only UI signal | `TreMount.cpp:345`, `contracts/tre.ts:124-125`, `treStore.ts:36-37` | `treMount.ts:174`, `MountedArchivesList.tsx:135-139` (per-entry extract failure) |
| `isCrcFirst(V0005)` | `fixtures-real/README.md:21` (`false`) | `TreVersion.h:106-108` (`true`; unused) |
| Historical size-first layout | `.planning/phases/01-01-SUMMARY.md:137` (Utinni size-first) | Current code/docs: crc-first all versions |
| Core3 / `'5000'` ↔ `'0005'` equivalence | `core3ServerPush.ts:35-36` | On-disk tag is literally `5000`, not `0005` (`packPatch.test.ts:55-59`) |
